(card "exp:F-R2-4_ofi_dir_align" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:F-R2-4_ofi_dir_align"
  :body "---\nnav: 29\ntype: experiment\nid: F-R2-4_ofi_dir_align\nshort_name: ofi_dir_align\ntitle: \"F-R2-4 — anchor + drop trades where OFI@30s > 0 (sell-side alignment)\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: f\nround: r2\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: \"[[lineages/arc_260516a__team_f__microstructure]]\"\ntrain_nav: 1.4698\ntrain_trade_count: 78\ntrain_win_rate: 0.8590\ntrain_sharpe: 6.7817\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0101\nval_nav_mean: 1.0296\nval_nav_sigma: 0.0308\nval_window_count: 13\ntest_nav: null\ntest_trade_count: null\ntest_sharpe: null\ntest_win_rate: null\ntest_max_drawdown: null\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: falsified\noutcome: no_test_run\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 0\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [microstructure, blacklist]\npast_only_window_days: null\nwarmup_required: null\ncreated: 2026-05-17T01:30:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/f, round/r2, axis/microstructure, axis/blacklist, status/falsified, outcome/no_test_run, leak/clean, size/small]\n---\n\n# F-R2-4 — anchor + drop trades where OFI@30s > 0\n\n> **TL;DR** —— F-R2 系列最激进 cutoff: 不用 quantile, 直接 drop 所有 OFI@30s > 0 的 trade (~50% drop)。train 78 笔 / NAV 1.47 << anchor 2.19。directional gate 在该 arc 完全不 productive。\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- 假设：OFI@30s > 0 = buy-side aggressive flow，与 short setups misaligned。drop 这类应当抬 win/sharpe。\n- 实测：trade_count 砍到 78 (anchor 140 的 56%)，NAV 直接腰斩 1.47。signal 选错方向。\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- 同 F-R2-1, gate = `OFI@30s > 0` instead of quantile cutoff. 78 笔.\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- OFI@30s past-only (trigger 前 30s 窗口). `#leak/clean`.\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 1.4698 | 78 | 6.78 | 85.9% | -1.01% |\n| Val (rolling 13w) | 1.0296 ± 0.031 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | NOT RUN (train fail + count_fail) | - | - | - | - |\n| **Δ train NAV vs anchor** | -0.72 | -62 | -0.92 | 0 | 0 |\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- overfit_score = 0; gate too aggressive, train fail.\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **same_axis**: [[arc_260516a__team_f__F-R1-1__ofi_drop_extreme]] (OFI-based filter)\n- **competes_with**: [[arc_260516a__team_f__F-R2-1__vpin_drop_q80_300s]]\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `team_f/output/cross_round_leaderboard_nav.csv` (F-R2-4)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- OFI directional gate (binary cut by sign) is too coarse. 改用 OFI magnitude × side alignment 作 size 而不是 binary admit.\n"
  :path "experiments/arc_260516a__team_f__F-R2-4__ofi_dir_align.md"
  :source_mtime "2026-05-17T10:29:15+08:00"
